     1,
     "Dear MSstats team, <div><br></div><div>I am new to MSstats and are trying to understand how the different functions work. I would like to understand the following steps that is performed during Spectronaut file conversion using SpectronauttoMSstatsFormat in MSstats version 4. </div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">INFO \r\n[2024-01-23 12:04:46] ** Intensities with values not smaller than 0.01\r\nin PGQvalue are replaced with NA</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">INFO \r\n[2024-01-23 12:04:46] ** Intensities with values not smaller than 0.01\r\nin EGQvalue are replaced with 0</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">What is being filtered here?</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">Kind regards</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">Suniya</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "yYHdU2pIAAAJ",
   "from": "Mateusz Staniak",
